The requirements.txt file contains all the libraries required for this project. 
Running condasetup.slurm will create an environment named "clarity5."

This project consists of five distinct parts: diffmode, binattse, binattse_vq, and binattse_encodec,
binattse_encodecvq. Each folder represents a completely independent section that can be run separately.

diffmode: This section represents models with different modes, including independent, backfusion, frontfusion, and binaural fusion. 

binattse and binattse_encodec: These sections represent models without vector quantization.

binattse_vq and binattse_encodecvq: These sections represent models that include vector quantizers.

Each folder contains an additional readme file that provides a more detailed explanation of the respective model.
